      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think you should replace the use of 127.0.0.0/8 network with 192.168.0.0/16 or maybe 10.0.0.0/8 would be easier replacement. Traffic addressed within 127.0.0.0/8 network typically won't leave a computer. Page about Localhost should have full details. \n\nI think following how it works on PC would be a bit easier on users. Have the Quest bind to the PC via whatever or service discovery, but add those SDK avatars to the \"other\" tab.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
